# Turn to Frog's only target gone: on turn 3 Bot1 casts it at Bot2's Llanowar Elves, and Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt at
# its own Elves, which resolves first and kills it. As Turn to Frog resolves its target is illegal, so it does nothing (CR
# 608.2b): Bot2's other Llanowar Elves is still a green 1/1 Elf Druid with its mana ability, and the spell goes to Bot1's
# graveyard. (The Elves is on top of the Bolt in Bot2's graveyard: the Bolt went there as its last step, CR 608.2n, before
# the state-based actions put the Elves there.)

